WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.459
Joining should take about a minute, and end with you signed in.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.973
Open Join and the member app shows the form from the mock: name, email, password,

00:00:12.973 --> 00:00:15.361
home church and what you are into.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.903
Home church is optional. Leave it blank, and the account has none.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.321
Press Create profile, and the button says Creating your profile until the answer

00:00:30.321 --> 00:00:31.053
arrives.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.708
Then you land on Home, signed in, greeted by your first name.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.607
One request creates the account, keeps only a hash of the password, and sets a

00:00:46.607 --> 00:00:48.207
secure session cookie.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:56.685
This is the first screen that calls the API, so a failing load now shows Something

00:00:56.685 --> 00:00:58.927
went wrong, and keeps the address.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.635
The HTTP client and the first form bring the first load to two hundred and

00:01:06.635 --> 00:01:08.250
fifty-five kilobytes.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:12.922
Every test failed first. Now they all pass.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:19.535
Next, slice two point two refuses invalid details.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:26.164
That's slice two point one. Christian Fitness: a Christian community for health in

00:01:26.164 --> 00:01:27.276
body and spirit.
